WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.910 --> 00:00:14.015
"What?" Zann cried.

2
00:00:14.035 --> 00:00:15.436
"What should we do?"

3
00:00:15.456 --> 00:00:17.057
"I can't stay."

4
00:00:17.618 --> 00:00:18.959
Ello was already rushing off.

5
00:00:18.979 --> 00:00:22.481
"Just—please—get yourself to safety!"

6
00:00:22.741 --> 00:00:24.142
he called out over his shoulder.

7
00:00:24.162 --> 00:00:26.304
"What are you waiting for?"

8
00:00:26.604 --> 00:00:27.304
Gliss exclaimed.

9
00:00:27.324 --> 00:00:28.625
"Let's get inland!"

10
00:00:28.645 --> 00:00:30.786
"Wait," Perda said.

11
00:00:30.806 --> 00:00:32.828
"I might have a better idea."

12
00:00:33.832 --> 00:00:35.734
Zann noticed that Perda looked thoughtful.

13
00:00:35.754 --> 00:00:37.075
"What is it?"

14
00:00:37.375 --> 00:00:37.796
he asked.

15
00:00:37.816 --> 00:00:44.361
"I couldn't sleep, so I've been lying here thinking about how we can get off this world," Perda

16
00:00:44.381 --> 00:00:49.146
said. "I may have come up with a plan."

17
00:00:49.186 --> 00:00:52.509
"This is never going to work."

18
00:00:53.530 --> 00:00:59.174
Gliss' voice shook as she glanced over the edge of the balcony at the dark, churning sea below.

19
00:00:59.194 --> 00:01:03.076
"It's a crazy plan!"

20
00:01:03.096 --> 00:01:03.496
"She's right."

21
00:01:03.717 --> 00:01:04.737
Darb sounded doubtful.

22
00:01:04.757 --> 00:01:06.598
"Too many things could go wrong.

23
00:01:07.459 --> 00:01:08.999
Maybe we should think about this some more."

24
00:01:10.100 --> 00:01:11.381
Zann glanced down too.

25
00:01:11.921 --> 00:01:13.402
The waves were wilder than ever.

26
00:01:14.342 --> 00:01:18.825
He wasn't sure if it was because of the growing storm, or because of the gulpers still swimming

27
00:01:18.885 --> 00:01:19.505
below their hut.

28
00:01:20.165 --> 00:01:20.846
Probably both.

29
00:01:20.866 --> 00:01:24.288
"I think Perda's plan could work," he said.

30
00:01:24.308 --> 00:01:26.489
"I know it's risky.

31
00:01:26.909 --> 00:01:30.231
But it could be our best chance of ever escaping from Skellia."

32
00:01:31.231 --> 00:01:31.892
Perda nodded.

33
00:01:32.224 --> 00:01:33.465
"Let's join friction."

34
00:01:34.706 --> 00:01:35.727
She held out her hands.

35
00:01:36.288 --> 00:01:38.089
Zann touched his palm to hers.

36
00:01:38.810 --> 00:01:41.532
Then he looked at Gliss and held out his other hand.

37
00:01:42.353 --> 00:01:43.494
She still looked scared.

38
00:01:43.894 --> 00:01:45.976
But she joined her palms with the others.

39
00:01:47.017 --> 00:01:49.719
"Stand in the middle of the circle," Zann told Darb.

40
00:01:49.739 --> 00:01:51.540
"And hang on to Zing."

41
00:01:52.241 --> 00:01:52.941
Darb nodded.

42
00:01:53.402 --> 00:01:56.004
Grabbing the dragon, he ducked under his friends' arms.

43
00:01:56.024 --> 00:01:58.926
"Ready?" Perda closed her eyes.

44
00:01:58.946 --> 00:02:00.528
"Protect!" "Protect!"

45
00:02:03.761 --> 00:02:05.002
Zann and Gliss chorused.

46
00:02:05.822 --> 00:02:09.064
Instantly they were surrounded by a glowing orange bubble.

47
00:02:09.944 --> 00:02:13.006
"Let's hope this Shield spell is strong enough," Perda said.

48
00:02:13.026 --> 00:02:18.669
"And let's hope Darb really can tell one gulper from another," Zann added.

49
00:02:18.689 --> 00:02:21.471
"I'm pretty sure I can," Darb said.

50
00:02:21.491 --> 00:02:23.512
"Pretty sure?"

51
00:02:23.932 --> 00:02:24.593
Gliss echoed.

52
00:02:25.053 --> 00:02:26.594
"Or really sure?"

53
00:02:26.614 --> 00:02:28.615
"Just come on."

54
00:02:28.935 --> 00:02:30.076
Perda sounded impatient.

55
00:02:30.980 --> 00:02:32.461
"Over to the edge, everyone."

56
00:02:33.441 --> 00:02:37.203
They shuffled to the edge of the balcony, still contained within the shield bubble.

57
00:02:37.223 --> 00:02:39.144
"Wait," Gliss said.

58
00:02:39.165 --> 00:02:40.585
"What happens next?"

59
00:02:41.506 --> 00:02:42.586
Perda rolled her eyes.

60
00:02:43.307 --> 00:02:45.768
She'd already explained her plan several times.

61
00:02:46.568 --> 00:02:49.990
But when Zann looked at Gliss, he couldn't help feeling sorry for her.

62
00:02:50.851 --> 00:02:52.291
She looked really scared.

63
00:02:53.552 --> 00:02:56.974
"We need to find that first gulper," he explained again.

64
00:02:56.994 --> 00:03:00.396
"The one Darb recognized back on the beach."

65
00:03:01.428 --> 00:03:02.669
"Right," Perda continued.

66
00:03:02.689 --> 00:03:08.072
"That gulper probably swallowed our wormhole, since it was the first one to arrive after we came through."

67
00:03:08.092 --> 00:03:14.456
"And we already know that even the strongest magic can't destroy a wormhole," Zann went on.

68
00:03:14.476 --> 00:03:19.679
"That means the wormhole will probably still be intact inside the gulper."

69
00:03:19.699 --> 00:03:21.920
"At least for a while."

70
00:03:22.260 --> 00:03:23.401
Darb sounded nervous.

71
00:03:23.421 --> 00:03:28.424
"If gulpers feed on magic energy, won't the wormhole be digested eventually?"

72
00:03:29.408 --> 00:03:33.130
"That's why we shouldn't waste any more time talking about it," Perda said.

73
00:03:33.150 --> 00:03:34.751
"Let's go!

74
00:03:35.632 --> 00:03:39.234
One, two, three Jump!"

75
00:03:39.494 --> 00:03:44.557
As they all leaped off the balcony, Zann held his breath, hoping the Shield spell would hold.

76
00:03:46.297 --> 00:03:51.380
Splash! The glowing bubble sank under the waves, but the water didn't get inside.

77
00:03:51.400 --> 00:03:53.041
"It's working!"

78
00:03:53.281 --> 00:03:53.842
Perda cried.

79
00:03:53.862 --> 00:03:55.563
"We can still breathe!"

80
00:03:55.583 --> 00:03:57.003
"Look out!"

81
00:03:57.223 --> 00:03:57.864
Darb pointed.

82
00:03:58.272 --> 00:04:00.473
"A gulper—and it's not the one we want!"

83
00:04:01.233 --> 00:04:03.974
"Away!" Zann yelled, rubbing his hands together.

84
00:04:04.794 --> 00:04:06.414
The bubble bounced away from the gulper.

85
00:04:06.434 --> 00:04:08.495
"More are coming!"

86
00:04:08.875 --> 00:04:09.575
Gliss exclaimed.

87
00:04:09.595 --> 00:04:13.576
"We have to find the original gulper," Perda cried.

88
00:04:13.596 --> 00:04:15.757
"Darb, do you see it?"

89
00:04:15.777 --> 00:04:17.077
"I'm looking."

90
00:04:17.477 --> 00:04:19.898
Darb was peering through the glowing orange wall.

91
00:04:19.918 --> 00:04:23.999
"There! I think that's the original gulper coming at us right now."

92
00:04:24.019 --> 00:04:26.720
"It's going to swallow us!"

93
00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:27.840
Gliss shrieked.

94
00:04:28.684 --> 00:04:31.466
"That's the whole idea," Perda reminded her.

95
00:04:32.347 --> 00:04:34.069
But her voice shook a little as she said it.

96
00:04:35.290 --> 00:04:37.151
Zann didn't blame them for being scared.

97
00:04:37.932 --> 00:04:44.438
He felt his own throat go dry with fear as the gulper swam closer, its enormous mouth gaping

98
00:04:44.538 --> 00:04:48.161
open, ready to swallow the entire group.

99
00:04:48.221 --> 00:04:49.802
Gulp! "Aah!"

100
00:04:50.363 --> 00:04:53.065
Zann cried as they were sucked into the gulper's mouth.

101
00:04:53.946 --> 00:04:56.008
For a moment he couldn't see anything.

102
00:04:56.992 --> 00:04:59.793
The inside of the gulper was dark and slimy.

103
00:04:59.813 --> 00:05:05.895
"It looks like they don't only eat magic," Perda said, wrinkling her nose at the smell.

104
00:05:05.915 --> 00:05:08.896
"They eat fish and other stuff too."

105
00:05:09.796 --> 00:05:11.616
"Does anyone see the wormhole?"

106
00:05:11.936 --> 00:05:12.557
Gliss asked.

107
00:05:12.577 --> 00:05:13.997
"There it is!"

108
00:05:14.417 --> 00:05:15.177
Darb pointed.

109
00:05:16.018 --> 00:05:19.139
Zann spun around and saw the wormhole glowing in the darkness.

110
00:05:19.159 --> 00:05:21.239
"Hurry!" he cried.

111
00:05:21.259 --> 00:05:23.520
"It looks kind of weak already!"

112
00:05:24.724 --> 00:05:27.565
"Quick, everybody join hands," Perda said.

113
00:05:28.425 --> 00:05:29.866
Zann grabbed Perda's hand.

114
00:05:30.466 --> 00:05:33.207
She grabbed Gliss' hand, and Gliss grabbed Darb's.

115
00:05:34.087 --> 00:05:35.187
Darb picked up Zing.

116
00:05:35.807 --> 00:05:37.948
Then Zann touched the side of the bubble.

117
00:05:37.968 --> 00:05:39.788
"Is everybody ready?"

118
00:05:40.549 --> 00:05:43.349
When the others nodded, he muttered, "Dissipate."

119
00:05:44.230 --> 00:05:48.511
He quickly sucked in a deep breath of air as the Shield spell bubble disappeared.

120
00:05:49.651 --> 00:05:51.832
The kids were plunged into watery coldness.

121
00:05:52.704 --> 00:05:55.885
Without the orange glow of the bubble, it was even harder to see.

122
00:05:56.785 --> 00:05:59.406
But the wormhole threw off a faint glow of its own.

123
00:06:00.266 --> 00:06:03.887
Zann kicked his feet, moving himself through the water with his free hand.

124
00:06:04.688 --> 00:06:06.868
Soon he felt the wormhole tugging at him.

125
00:06:07.728 --> 00:06:13.530
Its pull was surprisingly strong—so strong that he felt his hand slipping away from Perda's!

126
00:06:13.550 --> 00:06:19.732
"No!" He screamed, accidentally sucking in a mouthful of the disgusting water.

127
00:06:20.692 --> 00:06:26.234
Perda quickly restored the shackles that had bound their arms together back in Magica, and Zann felt his

128
00:06:26.374 --> 00:06:27.954
arm clamped safely to hers.

129
00:06:28.954 --> 00:06:34.376
A moment later the wormhole sucked them in, pressing all the breath from their bodies for a second

130
00:06:34.456 --> 00:06:37.477
before tossing them into the rushing whirl of the vortex.

131
00:06:39.257 --> 00:06:43.478
As Zann tumbled head over heels, he heard a sharp scream behind him.

132
00:06:44.459 --> 00:06:49.280
He glanced back just in time to see Gliss lose her grip on Perda's hand.

133
00:06:50.441 --> 00:06:52.106
"No!" Gliss shrieked.

134
00:06:52.828 --> 00:06:57.362
A second later she, Darb, and Zing were swept away out of sight!
